        <p>Málaga offers warm weather 300+ days per year, beautiful beaches, affordable living, and growing digital nomad community. Perfect for sun-seekers but smaller startup ecosystem than Madrid/Barcelona.</p>

        <h3>Top Spaces & Pricing:</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Workspace Málaga (Centro Histórico):</strong> Day €16, Monthly €200–240. Beachfront views, modern space, strong expat community. Best for lifestyle + work balance.</li>
          <li><strong>Hub-IT Málaga (El Limonar):</strong> Day €14, Monthly €170–200. Budget-friendly, reliable, quieter vibe. Good for focused work.</li>
          <li><strong>CoWorking Málaga (Pedregalejo Beach):</strong> Day €15, Monthly €185–220. Beachfront location, casual, perfect for afternoon beach breaks.</li>
