        <h3>Las Palmas:</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>CoWórking Las Palmas:</strong> Day €13, Monthly €130–160. Most affordable major coworking in Spain. Growing community. Best for budget nomads seeking Caribbean vibes.</li>
